    {"note": "In the per-scope build (board ab-v16.41) this is the receiver's close: in the removal queue, after the window rule, Target.closeTarget with the tab's target id (from debugger.getTargets) through chrome.debugger, so no beforeunload handler runs. The close ends at the tab's tabs.onRemoved. Before part 1a the receiver calls chrome.tabs.remove (chromeToday).", "req": {"t": "req", "id": "5f3a9c01-10", "op": "tabs.remove", "args": [8]}, "chrome": ["debugger.sendCommand", [{"tabId": 8}, "Target.closeTarget", {"targetId": "D8E9F0"}]], "chromeToday": ["tabs.remove", [8]], "res": {"t": "res", "ch": "bridge", "id": "5f3a9c01-10", "ok": true, "data": null}},
