    {"note": "Every entry of the tab-to-scope map at the moment of the answer (C10, board ab-v16.41): here tab 9 (windows.create above) and tab 12, a popup of tab 9. A tab of no scope and a marked tab are not in it. The relay calls it at each link up, after bridge.info.", "req": {"t": "req", "id": "5f3a9c01-21", "op": "bridge.tabScopes", "args": []}, "chrome": null, "res": {"t": "res", "ch": "bridge", "id": "5f3a9c01-21", "ok": true, "data": [{"tabId": 9, "scope": "my-repo"}, {"tabId": 12, "scope": "my-repo"}]}},
